; iter_inverted_skip: the skip clause is stated as start_idx >= end_idx,
; so an inverted range is empty rather than an error. Both implementations
; skip the body; neither faults.

VECI r0
PUSH 1
VECPUSH r0
PUSH 2
VECPUSH r0

PUSH 0
STOW r1

PUSH 2           ; start_idx
PUSH 1           ; end_idx (start > end)
ITER r0
LOAD r1
INC
STOW r1
NEXT

PUSH 0
OUTPUT r1
HALT
